# keep text files with LF line endings on every checkout (sync-ui patches the page with LF text)
* text=auto eol=lf
# The test vaults are byte-exact specimens: the plain one holds the CRLF the app writes, and the
# untraceable one is encrypted bytes compared with == to it. No line-ending conversion, ever.
src-tauri/tests/fixtures/** -text
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff2 binary
